    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:</i>&nbsp;<i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p><b>Manufactured By:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Infinite_Empire\" title=\"The Infinite Empire\">The Infinite Empire</a> </p><p><b>Applicable To:</b> Any Weapon </p><p>Crafted by an ancient and extremely advanced <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Species\" title=\"Species\">Species</a> known as the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Rakata\" title=\"Rakata\">Rakata</a>, Weapons with this <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Weapon_Templates\" title=\"Weapon Templates\">Weapon Template</a> are powerful and extremely alien to modern <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Species\" title=\"Species\">Species</a>. </p><p><b>Weapons:</b> Rakatan Manufacture Weapons increase their die type by one step (from d4 to d6, d6 to d8, d8 to d10, or d10 to a maximum of d12) and grant the wielder a +1 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> bonus on attack rolls. Rakatan Manufacture Weapons are considered&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Exotic_Weapons\" title=\"Exotic Weapons\">Exotic Weapons</a>&nbsp;for purposes of proficiency (except to a member of the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Rakata\" title=\"Rakata\">Rakata</a> Species). </p>",
